OL,3,GNEWSA'I just cried my eyes out' -
OL,4,Apassengers describe Tunisia flight
OL,5,Aordeal
OL,6,
OL,7,FA passenger has described her
OL,8,Fexperience as "hell" after she was one
OL,9,Fof dozens of people left stranded in
OL,10,FTunisia.
OL,12,FLorraine Molloy's flight home was
OL,13,Fcancelled four days ago, with EasyJet
OL,14,Finitially telling her and the other
OL,15,Fpassengers it had no other flights
OL,16,Favailable for another 10 days.
OL,18,FIn the early hours of Wednesday
OL,19,Fmorning, the airline was able to
OL,20,Forganise flights to return the stranded
OL,21,Fpassengers to Belfast.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
